<h1>The best Wanderhotel <br><strong>in the Black Forest</strong></h1>
<p>Unspoiled, rich in contrasts and full of <strong>natural gems:</strong> a hiking vacation in the Black Forest allows you to discover the whole <strong>diversity of Germany&#39;s low mountain range nature</strong>. From the dense, mysterious north to sunny meadow valleys and the almost 1,500-meter-high mountain ranges in the south – each region has its own magic.</p>
<p>The famous <strong>Westweg</strong>, stretching 285 kilometers from Pforzheim to Basel, is the oldest <strong>long-distance hiking trail in Germany</strong> – and still one of the most beautiful. It is complemented by around 24,000 kilometers of well-signposted <strong>hiking trails</strong> that lead to <strong>inspiring landscapes</strong> and pleasant tranquility on a hiking vacation in Germany.</p>
